
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
    PROGRAM-ID. STUDENT-MARKS.
    AUTHOR. SIVA.

DATA DIVISION.
    WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

    01 STUDENT-NAME PIC X(20).
    01 MARK1        PIC 999.
    01 MARK2        PIC 999.
    01 MARK3        PIC 999.
    01 TOTAL        PIC 9(4).
    01 AVERAGE      PIC 999V99.
    01 RESULT       PIC X(10).

PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    DISPLAY "STUDENT MARK SHEET".

    DISPLAY "ENTER STUDENT NAME:".
    ACCEPT STUDENT-NAME.
 
    DISPLAY "ENTER MARK 1:".
    ACCEPT MARK1.

    DISPLAY "ENTER MARK 2:".
    ACCEPT MARK2.

    DISPLAY "ENTER MARK 3:".
    ACCEPT MARK3.

    COMPUTE TOTAL = MARK1 + MARK2 + MARK3.
    COMPUTE AVERAGE = TOTAL / 3.

    IF MARK1 >= 35 AND
       MARK2 >= 35 AND
       MARK3 >= 35
        MOVE "PASS" TO RESULT
    ELSE
        MOVE "FAIL" TO RESULT
    END-IF.

    DISPLAY "------------------------".
    DISPLAY "NAME: " STUDENT-NAME.
    DISPLAY "TOTAL: " TOTAL.
    DISPLAY "AVERAGE: " AVERAGE.
    DISPLAY "RESULT: " RESULT.

    STOP RUN.
